    </div>
    <div class="col-6 col-md-4 col-lg-2">
        <div class="card h-100 border">
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/119/300" class="card-img-top" alt="Loa bluetooth mini" />
            <div class="card-body p-2">
                <p class="small mb-2">Loa bluetooth mini âm bass mạnh, pin 12 giờ</p>
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
